  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/jchristn/durable",
  "published": "2026-10-07T01:19:14.713Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.5.0 (breaking): Native AOT and trimming support (DynamicallyAccessedMembers annotations, no runtime codegen under AOT, DurableJson for source-generated JSON, EntityMetadata.RequiredMemberTypes); QueryEvaluator<TRow> public for non-SQL backends; TransactionScope renamed AmbientTransactionScope (IAsyncDisposable; Durable does not participate in System.Transactions); ImprovedMergeChangesResolver folded into MergeChangesResolver with MergeConflictBehavior; resolver async methods take a CancellationToken; [VersionColumn] infers its type, RowVersion renamed BinaryCounter; ReadFirstOrDefault and BatchDelete removed (use ReadFirst, DeleteMany); include-query switches and RepositoryExtensions removed (use the *WithQuery methods); RepositorySettings/RepositoryType moved to Durable.Sql. See CHANGELOG.md for migration hints.",
